<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - July 24.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - July 24.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain</p>
<p>trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk Jul 82.00</p>
<p>Avon range Jul 83.00 Harvest 77.50 Sep 79.50/80.00 Oct/Dec 84.50/85.00</p>
<p>Shropshire/Chesshire Jul 83.00 Sep 79.00 Oct/Dec 85.00</p>
<p>Devon Jul 83.00</p>
<p>Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire, Northamptonshire, and Oxfordshire Jul 81.50</p>
<p>Herefordshire Jul 82.00</p>
</text>
